  "body": "A user should never be advised to do chmod 777 on the system, as there are always some users who follow the manual. Please fix the documentation. (I have not tested what  authbind manual tells but, chmod 555  should be enough here) \r\n\r\ngrep -R 777 *: \r\n\r\ndocs/ACME.md:sudo chmod 777 /etc/authbind/byport/80",
